_:cb171f51993e5cb8de0229c7106adc40eff2bae6dd9963143823682a9961a548f9f <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The sets of experimental data were recorded on several instruments within COMTES FHT. In cases where possible (XRD, MTT, EBSD), the data are in xlsx format enabling any replotting."@en .
